---
import { ChevronRight } from "@lucide/astro";
---

<section class="section section-faq">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-10">
      <div>
        <h2 class="h3">Frequently asked questions</h2>

        <p class="text-base text-custom-grey-100 mb-8">
          Find quick solutions and helpful tips for using Zeepay. We’ve compiled
          answers to the most frequently asked questions right here.
        </p>

        <a
          href="/contact"
          class="btn btn-lg w-full sm:w-auto rounded-md bg-main hover:bg-blue-600 border-main text-white font-light"
        >
          Contact support
          <ChevronRight size="14" />
        </a>
      </div>

      <div class="grid gap-3">
        <!-- Item -->
        <div class="collapse collapse-arrow bg-base-100 border border-base-300">
          <input
            type="radio"
            name="faq-accordion"
            checked="checked"
            aria-hidden="true"
            tabindex="-1"
          />

          <div class="collapse-title font-semibold">
            What is Zeepay?
          </div>

          <div class="collapse-content text-sm">
            Zeepay is a secure, user-friendly online payment app that allows
            users to send and receive money, pay bills, and manage transactions
            effortlessly.
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Item -->
        <div class="collapse collapse-arrow bg-base-100 border border-base-300">
          <input
            type="radio"
            name="faq-accordion"
            aria-hidden="true"
            tabindex="-1"
          />

          <div class="collapse-title font-semibold">
            How do I sign up for Zeepay?
          </div>

          <div class="collapse-content text-sm">
            Download the app or visit the website, then click “Sign Up” and
            follow the registration process.
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Item -->
        <div class="collapse collapse-arrow bg-base-100 border border-base-300">
          <input
            type="radio"
            name="faq-accordion"
            aria-hidden="true"
            tabindex="-1"
          />

          <div class="collapse-title font-semibold">
            Is Zeepay safe to use?
          </div>

          <div class="collapse-content text-sm">
            Yes. Zeepay uses encryption, secure authentication, and fraud
            protection measures to keep your transactions and personal data
            safe.
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Item -->
        <div class="collapse collapse-arrow bg-base-100 border border-base-300">
          <input
            type="radio"
            name="faq-accordion"
            aria-hidden="true"
            tabindex="-1"
          />

          <div class="collapse-title font-semibold">
            What payment methods does Zeepay support?
          </div>

          <div class="collapse-content text-sm">
            Zeepay supports bank cards, mobile wallets, bank transfers, and
            other popular payment methods depending on your region.
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Item -->
        <div class="collapse collapse-arrow bg-base-100 border border-base-300">
          <input
            type="radio"
            name="faq-accordion"
            aria-hidden="true"
            tabindex="-1"
          />

          <div class="collapse-title font-semibold">
            Can I pay bills using Zeepay?
          </div>

          <div class="collapse-content text-sm">
            Yes. You can pay utility bills, subscriptions, and other services
            directly through the Zeepay app.
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>